  "idea": "Stirling-PDF: 100 percent free open-source PDF power tool",
  "text": "Stop paying Adobe twenty dollars every month just to edit and merge PDFs. Small teams hit paywalls whenever clients send legal contracts requiring redactions or digital signatures. Free web tools leak confidential data while commercial desktop suites lock compression behind subscriptions. Stirling-PDF runs locally via Docker, providing fifty document manipulation utilities completely free. You get private OCR and unlimited file conversions forever.",
